# Local run output. May hold account ids and raw engine logs; never committed.
runs/
# The owner's allowlist, and any copy of it (a backup, an editor's swap or tilde file). Its
# SHA-256 values can be reversed to the account id, and this repository is public, so none of
# them is ever committed. A contract meant for the repository would need `git add -f`.
*.contract.json*
